   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "fleet-app: one Node process\n\n· MQTT subscriber\n· validate → INSERT … ON CONFLICT\n   (one transaction per message)\n· ack after commit\n· HTTP API (reads, commands)\n· health job (offline / stale / gaps)\n· /metrics",
   "originalText": "fleet-app: one Node process\n\n· MQTT subscriber\n· validate → INSERT … ON CONFLICT\n   (one transaction per message)\n· ack after commit\n· HTTP API (reads, commands)\n· health job (offline / stale / gaps)\n· /metrics",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
