   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Day-1 rules that never change\n· idempotent key (device, epoch, seq)\n· ack only after commit\n· per-gateway mTLS identity\n· metrics + one alert from day 1",
   "originalText": "Day-1 rules that never change\n· idempotent key (device, epoch, seq)\n· ack only after commit\n· per-gateway mTLS identity\n· metrics + one alert from day 1",
