   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What breaks first\n· one INSERT per message caps throughput\n· a heavy API query or GC pause stalls\n   ingest (one event loop for everything)\n· one process = one failure domain\n· can't scale ingest without the API",
   "originalText": "What breaks first\n· one INSERT per message caps throughput\n· a heavy API query or GC pause stalls\n   ingest (one event loop for everything)\n· one process = one failure domain\n· can't scale ingest without the API",
