  {
   "id": "text-81",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1312,
   "y": 1214.375,
   "width": 412.50000000000006,
   "height": 131.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2063281257,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2078054028,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Backpressure chain (where it really stops)\nPostgres slow → no COMMIT → ingest sends no PUBACK\n→ Receive Max reached → broker stops delivering\n→ broker queue grows, up to its bound\n→ over the bound: drops are counted and alerted\nThe gateway buffer covers WAN loss only:\nthe broker PUBACKs the gateway on receipt.",
   "originalText": "Backpressure chain (where it really stops)\nPostgres slow → no COMMIT → ingest sends no PUBACK\n→ Receive Max reached → broker stops delivering\n→ broker queue grows, up to its bound\n→ over the bound: drops are counted and alerted\nThe gateway buffer covers WAN loss only:\nthe broker PUBACKs the gateway on receipt.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rectangle-80",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "rectangle-82",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 1410,
   "width": 580,
   "height": 240,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1339395519,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 368871839,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "text-83"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "text-83",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1312,
   "y": 1445.625,
   "width": 470.25000000000006,
   "height": 168.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 618979931,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 438892468,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Guarantee (README wording)\nno loss, unless the broker crashes while a backlog exists\n(≤ 5 s of queue lost) or the backlog outgrows the bound\n(drops counted + alerted)\n\nWhat breaks next\n· one broker = crash window, memory-bound outages\n· shared subscriptions don't rebalance a dead member\n· one big table; retention by DELETE gets slow",
   "originalText": "Guarantee (README wording)\nno loss, unless the broker crashes while a backlog exists\n(≤ 5 s of queue lost) or the backlog outgrows the bound\n(drops counted + alerted)\n\nWhat breaks next\n· one broker = crash window, memory-bound outages\n· shared subscriptions don't rebalance a dead member\n· one big table; retention by DELETE gets slow",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rectangle-82",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
