  {
   "id": "text-135",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 52,
   "y": 2453.75,
   "width": 668.25,
   "height": 112.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 265236939,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1400082662,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What changed and why\n· the log, not broker memory, is the buffer: outage window = log retention (days)\n· consumer groups rebalance partitions → a dead worker's share really moves\n· replay from any offset: reprocess, backfill, fix a bug and re-run\n· partition key = deviceId keeps per-device order\n· time partitions make retention a DROP instead of a DELETE",
   "originalText": "What changed and why\n· the log, not broker memory, is the buffer: outage window = log retention (days)\n· consumer groups rebalance partitions → a dead worker's share really moves\n· replay from any offset: reprocess, backfill, fix a bug and re-run\n· partition key = deviceId keeps per-device order\n· time partitions make retention a DROP instead of a DELETE",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rectangle-134",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "rectangle-136",
